<title>USA: Cognizant Corp to be added to S&amp;P 500.</title>
<headline>Cognizant Corp to be added to S&amp;P 500.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said Friday that it is adding Cognizant Corp to the S&amp;P 500 Index, in place of Yellow Corp, which will be transferred to the S&amp;P SmallCap 600 Index.</p>
<p>Dun &amp; Bradstreet Corp, which spun off Cognizant, will remain in the S&amp;P 500 Index, the agency said.</p>
</text>
